    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, something's wrong. Don't you think it's strange that we were able to enter the headquarters so easily?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "text": "There were so many Reunion forces outside so we braced ourselves for a hard fight, but it was as if they were sleepwalking."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "text": "According to our scouts' intel, their equipment is practically damaged to the point of unusability. It's unlikely that they've seen much combat, and their degree of preparedness seems..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "text": "It creeps me out."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I've noticed as well. They don't even know we're here. At least they're not a threat right now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "We'll follow the plan. Next, our non-combat squads will scout out the distribution of Reunion forces on each floor, and attempt to restart the security system that was disabled earlier."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Additionally, we'll need to be ready to hold off a possible Reunion encirclement. We must hold out until our plan is implemented smoothly."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_015_lmg"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Focus your attention on controlling the situation inside."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
