        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_015_lmg"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "text": "According to our sources, Reunion's temporary command center is on the rooftop."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "The rooftop? What kind of leader would put their command center on the roof?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Hmm... there's a significant possibility of this being a trap."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "text": "But we don't have a choice, do we, Madam?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "That's right. Taking back the rooftop would be like lighting Lungmen's signal beacon. We will let Reunion witness the moment when the L.G.D. Headquarters returns to our hands."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "We ought to lead them all here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Get ready, there are still a few hours to go. Let the recon and engineer squads go first. The combat squads still have some time to rest up before the main operation begins."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Don't waste even the smallest opportunity to create an advantage. Expect our enemies to fight to the death."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
