            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, something doesn't feel right about this building."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "What do you mean?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "text": "Let me make a conjecture first. As we get closer to the top floor, we may encounter some resistance. Perhaps there are some enemies stationed on the roof."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "text": "However, the lower floors were completely empty. Only on the sixth floor did enemies start to appear, and while their numbers have increased, they haven't posed any threat."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "text": "Just now, one of my squad members reported that he thought he saw some Reunion members walk down a corridor, but they disappeared in the blink of an eye."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "text": "Another member told me that he heard some whispering, but when he went to investigate, he didn't find anything."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "text": "That's all we found from our investigation. But something feels wrong to me still."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Let's go first. I don't have time for your nonsensical ghost stories."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Even if there was something anomalous going on, I'll handle it after this is all over."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_015_lmg"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "text": "Yes ma'am!"
    },
